{
	title: 'Initial Hal message has one blank row',
	spec: 'The terminal frame owns the single blank row at its top: a first transcript item whose first row has text gets one blank above it, and the chrome of an empty transcript gets one blank above it. The renderer adds no separate startup gap, so an empty first paint followed by a first message never stacks two blanks. Spacing between transcript items is unchanged. Invariant: the frame never starts with text at its top edge and never with two blank rows.',
